title: "The F*** Index: What Claude Code's Telemetry Tells Us About Measuring AI Performance"
description: "Inside the profanity detector, the 'keep going' flag, and the surprisingly difficult problem of deciding whether an AI coding agent is actually doing a good job."
date: 2026-07-27
